              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "In this reaction, Au"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "+"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " is reduced to Au and Zn is oxidized to Zn"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "2+"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". Write the half-reactions, balance the atoms and electrons, and add the half-reactions to determine the overall reaction and standard cell potential:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "5b7njl22nqsu2hc",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "6flxwdrtbkb7oa0",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "9bvv2kv4ivclpqc",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\begin{array}{l}\\mathrm{reduction}:\\;\\;\\;2\\;\\mathrm{Au}^+(aq)\\;+\\;2\\;\\mathrm e^-\\;\\rightarrow\\; 2\\;\\mathrm{Au}(s)\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\mathrm E^\\circ\\; =\\;+1.69\\;\\mathrm V\\\\\\underline{\\mathrm{oxidation}:\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\; \\mathrm{Zn}(s)\\;\\rightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Zn}^{2+}(aq)\\;+\\;2\\mathrm e^-\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\; \\mathrm E^\\circ\\;=\\;+0.76\\;\\mathrm V}\\\\\\mathrm{overall}:\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;2\\;\\mathrm{Au}^+(\\mathrm{aq})\\; +\\;\\mathrm{Zn}(s)\\;\\rightarrow\\;2\\;\\mathrm{Au}(\\mathrm s)\\;+\\;\\mathrm{Zn}^{2+}(aq\\mathit)\\;\\;\\;\\;\\;\\; \\mathrm E^\\circ\\;=\\;+2.45\\;\\mathrm V\\end{array}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The same result is obtained using "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": ""
                      }
                    ],
                    "legacyBlockRendered": false,
                    "src": "{E^\\circ}_{\\mathrm{cell}}\\;=\\;{E^\\circ}_{\\mathrm{cathode}}\\; -\\;{E^\\circ}_{\\mathrm{anode}}",
